            },
            "text_WnMKmY": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>The label Achin Bindlish was founded on a shared belief: that in fashion, the only constant is change, yet true luxury must remain rooted in substance. This balance is the heartbeat of our brand, brainchild of co-founders <strong>Achin Bindlish and Ayush Bansal.</strong></p><p>Together, they represent the perfect fusion of the tradition and contemporary. Achin is the anchor of our heritage. With over two decades of immersion in the industry, he brings an unparalleled mastery of fabric and the \"Roots\" of Indian craftsmanship. He ensures that every creation honors the traditions we come from.</p><p></p><p>Ayush, his partner in this vision, is the architect of our contemporary spirit. He ensures that craftmanship and tradition peak world of today.</p><p></p><p>By joining forces, Achin and Ayush have become the actors of change, translating the soul of heritage craftsmanship into a modern business of timeless elegance. </p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "none",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "rte",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "1rem",
                "line_height": "normal",
